    cof:title "18 At the end of section 52" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (3) For the purposes of the Administrative Appeals Tribunal reviewing a decision of a kind referred to in paragraph (1)(b):  (a) the Tribunal must not exercise the power under subsection 22A(1A) or 22B(1A); and  (b) the Tribunal must not review any exercise of the power or any failure to exercise the power." ;
